[36m(TaskRunner pid=1540138)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1540138)[0m \[ \text{Time taken} = \frac{9}{10.5} \text{ hours} \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1540138)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1540138)[0m Let's calculate this time in minutes.
