[36m(TaskRunner pid=1540138)[0m ### 步骤 4：解方程
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1540138)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1540138)[0m 从方程 (1)：
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1540138)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1540138)[0m \frac{9}{s} + \frac{t}{60} = 4 \quad \text{(1)}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1540138)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1540138)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1540138)[0m 从方程 (2)：
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1540138)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1540138)[0m \frac{9}{s + 2} + \frac{t}{60} = 2.4 \quad \text{(2)}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1540138)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1540138)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1540138)[0m 将方程 (1) 和方程 (2) 减去，消去 \( \frac{t}{60} \)：
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1540138)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1540138)[0m \frac{9}{s} - \frac{9}{s + 2} = 4 - 2.4 = 1.6
