[36m(TaskRunner pid=1540138)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1540138)[0m 化简：
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1540138)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1540138)[0m \frac{9(s + 2) - 9s}{s(s + 2)} = 1.6
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1540138)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1540138)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1540138)[0m \frac{18}{s(s + 2)} = 1.6
