[36m(TaskRunner pid=1540138)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1540138)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1540138)[0m 解这个二次方程：
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1540138)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1540138)[0m s = \frac{-3.2 \pm \sqrt{(3.2)^2 - 4 \cdot 1.6 \cdot (-18)}}{2 \cdot 1.6}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1540138)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1540138)[0m \[
