[36m(TaskRunner pid=1540138)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1540138)[0m Divide both sides by 96:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1540138)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1540138)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1540138)[0m \frac{1080}{96} = s(s+2)
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1540138)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1540138)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1540138)[0m Simplify:
