[36m(TaskRunner pid=1540138)[0m ---
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1540138)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1540138)[0m ### **Step 5: Find $ t $**
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1540138)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1540138)[0m Now plug $ s = 2.5 $ into Equation 1a:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1540138)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1540138)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1540138)[0m \frac{9}{2.5} + t = 4
