[36m(TaskRunner pid=1540138)[0m ### **Step 4: Solve the system of equations**
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1540138)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1540138)[0m From equation (1):
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1540138)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1540138)[0m \frac{9}{s} + \frac{t}{60} = 4 \quad \text{(1)}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1540138)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1540138)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1540138)[0m From equation (2):
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1540138)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1540138)[0m \frac{9}{s+2} + \frac{t}{60} = 2.4 \quad \text{(2)}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1540138)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1540138)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1540138)[0m Subtract equation (1) from equation (2):
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1540138)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1540138)[0m \left( \frac{9}{s+2} - \frac{9}{s} \right) + \frac{t}{60} - \frac{t}{60} = 2.4 - 4
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1540138)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1540138)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1540138)[0m \frac{9}{s+2} - \frac{9}{s} = -1.6
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1540138)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1540138)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1540138)[0m Now, simplify the left-hand side:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1540138)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1540138)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1540138)[0m \frac{9}{s+2} - \frac{9}{s} = 9 \left( \frac{1}{s+2} - \frac{1}{s} \right) = 9 \left( \frac{s - (s + 2)}{s(s + 2)} \right) = 9 \left( \frac{-2}{s(s + 2)} \right) = \frac{-18}{s(s + 2)}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1540138)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1540138)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1540138)[0m So:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1540138)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1540138)[0m \frac{-18}{s(s + 2)} = -1.6
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1540138)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1540138)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1540138)[0m \frac{18}{s(s + 2)} = 1.6
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1540138)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1540138)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1540138)[0m s(s + 2) = \frac{18}{1.6} = 11.25
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1540138)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1540138)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1540138)[0m s^2 + 2s - 11.25 = 0
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1540138)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1540138)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1540138)[0m Now solve this quadratic equation:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1540138)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1540138)[0m $$
